<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>cute!</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">22december</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">cute!</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">79EMXU97YgEyZfc3TylkCU</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.697" end="00:08.199">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.199" end="00:09.699">Okayjml</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.944" end="00:10.695" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.695" end="00:12.195">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.693" end="00:13.193">Cute goth bitch, yeah, she dressed in all-black</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.949" end="00:15.445">Yeah, shawty wanna **** me while I'm countin' all my cash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.445" end="00:17.941">I'ma roll another blunt 'cause I'm smokin' all this gas</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.941" end="00:20.699">Bitch, I only pull a .40 if you talkin' all that smack, ayy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.699" end="00:22.947">New whip, new bitch in the back seat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.947" end="00:25.197">Send that ho a text, tell her, "Come over and top me"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.197" end="00:27.439">Shawty hella cute, but she also hella crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.439" end="00:29.948">Got a couple racks and a brand new whip, Mercedes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.948" end="00:32.198">Cute goth bitch, yeah, she dressed in all-black</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.198" end="00:34.694">Yeah, shawty wanna **** me while I'm countin' all my cash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.694" end="00:36.948">I'ma roll another blunt 'cause I'm smokin' all this gas</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.948" end="00:39.944">Bitch, I only pull a .40 if you talkin' all that smack, ayy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.944" end="00:41.941">New whip, new bitch in the back seat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.941" end="00:44.453">Send that ho a text, tell her, "Come over and top me"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.453" end="00:46.700">Shawty hella cute, but she also hella crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.700" end="00:48.200">Got a couple racks and a brand new whip, Mercedes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.945" end="00:49.445" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.707" end="00:50.207">[Verse]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.202" end="00:51.450">Cute goth bitch, yeah, she always hit my line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.450" end="00:53.701">See like ten missed calls 'cause I always hit decline</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.701" end="00:56.197">I ain't ****ing with that fake love, that's a waste of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.197" end="00:58.950">Shawty, if you really care, then you will wanna be mine, ayy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.950" end="01:00.702">Hundred round drum, I ain't missin' a shot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.702" end="01:03.444">Hit yo' dome, make you drop, guess you ran out of luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.444" end="01:05.952">Chrome Hearts on the jeans, bad bitch on her knees</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.952" end="01:07.452">Came in with the ****ing Uzi, got the swish, lemon squeeze</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.199" end="01:08.699" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.695" end="01:09.195">[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.702" end="01:10.202">Ayy, If you wanna dance, throw it back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.200" end="01:12.442">I got hundreds and fifties, I make it rain on her ass, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.442" end="01:14.950">Shawty gon' throw it on me and she gon' make it clap</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.950" end="01:17.445">And we smokin' that pressure, we gettin' lit up off the gas</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.445" end="01:19.701">Ayy, If you wanna dance, throw it back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.701" end="01:22.197">I got hundreds and fifties, I make it rain on her ass, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.197" end="01:24.449">Shawty gon' throw it on me and she gon' make it clap</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.449" end="01:25.949" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And we smokin' that pressure, we gettin' lit up off the gas (Ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.192" end="01:26.692" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.703" end="01:27.701">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.701" end="01:29.697">Cute goth bitch, yeah, she dressed in all-black</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.697" end="01:32.193">Yeah, shawty wanna **** me while I'm countin' all my cash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.193" end="01:34.444">I'ma roll another blunt while I'm smokin' on that gas</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.444" end="01:37.451">Bitch, I only pull a .40 if you talkin' all that smack, ayy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.451" end="01:39.694">New whip, new bitch in the back seat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.694" end="01:41.945">Send that ho a text, tell her, "Come over and top me"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.945" end="01:44.199">Shawty hella cute, but she also hella crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.199" end="01:46.695">Got a couple racks and a brand new whip, Mercedes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.695" end="01:48.946">Cute goth bitch, yeah, she dressed in all-black</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.946" end="01:51.453">Yeah, shawty wanna **** me while I'm countin' all my cash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.453" end="01:53.950">I'ma roll another blunt 'cause I'm smokin' all this gas</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.950" end="01:56.703">Bitch, I only pull a .40 if you talkin' all that smack, ayy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.703" end="01:58.700">New whip, new bitch in the back seat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.700" end="02:01.197">Send that ho a text, tell her, "Come over and top me"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.197" end="02:03.449">Shawty hella cute, but she also hella crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.449" end="02:07.449">Got a couple racks and a brand new whip, Mercedes</p></div></body></tt>